Package: softglowos-vendor-apps
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Kevin Schmidt <https://github.com/kevinschmidt777/softglowos>
Homepage: https://softglowos.com
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: curl, ca-certificates, apt, procps, systemd
Description: Chrome and Discord from their vendors
 Their licenses don't allow putting them into SoftglowOS, so a timer fetches
 the official packages from Google and Discord once the computer is online.
 Each is installed once and stays removed if removed. Chrome updates through
 Google's repository, Discord through this timer while it isn't running.
